      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a very common, yet deeply painful, feeling of creative stagnation. Remember that creative peaks aren't permanent; they are moments, and the valleys are just as real. Instead of mourning the past version of yourself, perhaps you could focus on what you can build *now*, even if it feels small. Sometimes the pressure to recreate a past \"spark\" is what suffocates the current effort.",
